p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, the player with the least amount of money is eliminated from the table.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why is Double It fun?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in multiplayer or single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join voice chat with other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand out with unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular updates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh and immersive experience</p></li></ul>","developers":["Anisage Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587090/8605c5ac837204694b4d33448ea8078f28260e64/header.jpg?t=1752253270","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3587090/268210857/b7b5787df3c64b3aa893567eabda494a105851c4/1750462528/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746997222","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3587090/268210857/b7b5787df3c64b3aa893567eabda494a105851c4/1750462528/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746997222","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3587090/268210857/b7b5787df3c64b3aa893567eabda494a105851c4/1750462528/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746997222","id":257138170,"name":"Cinematic Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257138170/764bc3547e10273d622617058e0384cf67292fe3/movie_600x337.